Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 06:09:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 33/49] Autofill SaveUi URL validation and FLAG_IMMUTABLE

This change enhances the security of the Autofill Save UI by strictly enforcing http and https schemes for custom description links, preventing custom scheme hijacking. Additionally, it switches the PendingIntent created in SaveUi to be immutable (FLAG_IMMUTABLE), preventing potential intent manipulation by recipient applications.

Bug: 465446148
Test: Verified with PoC test app
Test: Verified with customized autofill test app
Test: atest CtsAutoFillServiceTestCases
Flag: EXEMPT CVE_FIX
